h('Findings and investment judgment')
p('The actual finrobot_equity two-step pipeline generated eight typed-agent sections and HTML reports for NVDA, AMD, INTC, AAPL and MSFT, all verified as Technology by FMP profiles. GOOGL was also run to complete the course starter set. Each company has at least two peer inputs. This is broad sector coverage: semiconductor, hardware and software peers have limited valuation comparability.')
p('Would I hand these reports to a portfolio manager? Only as clearly labelled research drafts with an audit attached. News access returned HTTP 402, yet the news agent asserted headlines and analyst consensus. Regulatory, competitive and supply-chain assertions often lacked supplied evidence. A successful model response is not evidence of factual correctness.')
p('Two-company financial audit: 20 NVDA/AMD metric comparisons produced 16 matches and four EBITDA or EBITDA-margin definition differences. Original issuer filings and SEC facts are preserved. AMD cash-flow D&amp;A is $750m plus $2,254m amortization, or $3,004m. The FMP EBITDA definition differs from operating income plus D&amp;A; full non-operating reconciliation remains unresolved.')
p('The forecast patch fixes historical years mislabelled as forecasts: future-year validity rose from 8/15 to 15/15 in actual FMP outputs. However, 68 supplemental rolling-origin SEC tests show pooled MAPE worsening from 13.7372% to 15.8580%. The improvement is temporal consistency, not demonstrated predictive accuracy.')
p('Five DCF recomputations agree arithmetically. Valuation quality remains weak: CFO less capex is not unlevered FCFF, net debt is synthetically set at 10% of EV, and the share denominator is FY weighted-average diluted shares. Growth, WACC and terminal growth are assumptions. No defensible Buy/Sell recommendation follows from these mechanical scenarios.')
p('Course deadline is October 12, 2026. The exact hour and submission timezone could not be established; the CourseWorks timezone America/New_York does not prove the GitHub submission cutoff. No midnight assumption, publication or submission was made.')
