p('Five documented review corrections were applied. Examples: historical 2025A revenue was misrepresented as forward guidance; a compound claim combined correct revenue numbers with an unsupported customer-adoption explanation. Original model classifications and corrected claim tables remain available. Lowest supported rates occur in competitor and company overview sections, consistent with prompts asking for contextual facts absent from financial tables.')
